OL,3,GNEWSACouncil plans #9.5m revamp of town
OL,4,Ashopping centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FAround a third of a town's aging
OL,7,Fshopping mall could be demolished under
OL,8,Fplans to reshape a town centre as
OL,9,Fshopping habits change.
OL,11,FBuilt in the late 1970s, Fareham
OL,12,FShopping Centre was "too big" and
OL,13,Flarger than current retail demand
OL,14,Frequired, with long-term vacant units
OL,15,Fthat are not expected to be filled,
OL,16,Fsaid the borough council.
OL,18,FFareham Borough Council said plans to
OL,19,Finvest #9.5m upgrading the remaining
OL,20,Fparts of the complex while removing
OL,21,Fspace no longer needed.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
