OL,3,GNEWSACouncil plans #9.5m revamp of town
OL,4,Ashopping centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking during a presentation on the
OL,7,FHampshire council's plans on Thursday,
OL,8,Fhead of regeneration Kirstin Chow said
OL,9,Fthe growth of online shopping had
OL,10,Fcreated a "very challenging
OL,11,Fenvironment" for towns the size of
OL,12,FFareham.
